# Real offline generator with mocked provider; no discovery or live model calls.
name: Accepted Map carries consumed calls into a separately approved scan plan
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 context-draft | context-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT JOB RESULT | context-result
keys: m
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | generated-map
keys: u
require-live-snap: 20 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
require-live-snap: 20 TOOLS | scanner
submit: options sast:scan
require-live-snap: 20 sast:scan | scanner-options
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks secret-scan
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | inherited-form
expect: 1 committed / 5 total
expect: 2 protected review
expect: 3 passes · 1 worker
ask: Does an ordinary scan form retain the generated Map's consumed call, protected review and three-pass single-worker default without implying this new plan is approved?
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 1 committed / 5 total | inherited-budget
expect: revision 1
expect-not: APPROVED STUDY
resize: 80x24
live-snap: budget-80
ask: At 80x24, are retained consumption, the next action and detail paging understandable?
resize: 60x20
live-snap: budget-60
ask: At 60x20, can the operator inspect the shared allowance without losing navigation?
resize: 40x12
live-snap: budget-40
expect: Esc back
ask: At 40x12, are the next action and paging controls readable while the retained accounting remains inspectable?
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 15 Dollar ceiling not | budget-40-last-page
expect: enforced.
ask: Can the operator read the complete retained accounting and dollar-limit disclosure at 40x12 without losing the controls?
keys: PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage
resize: 96x89
live-snap: budget-tall
ask: Does the tall budget form keep coherent hierarchy and explicit next actions?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: budget-wide
ask: Does the wide budget form clearly distinguish consumed calls, remaining discovery and protected review?
resize: 120x36
keys: L
wait-for: 30 Draft ready
require-live-snap: 30 Enter / L next | scan-draft
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
expect: Draft ready
expect: 1 committed / 5 total
ask: Does preparing three exact-context passes preserve spending while leaving the new work unapproved and unstarted?
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | scan-approval
expect: revision 1 → 2
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 y approve | approval-last
ask: Does the approval document name the replacement plan, exact model and unchanged limits before authorizing its fixed jobs?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 APPROVED STUDY | approved-scan
expect: 1 committed / 5 total
expect: 2 protected review
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART approved
ask: Does approval preserve the call already consumed by Map and leave starting discovery as a separate action?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | new-form-after-restart
expect: 1 committed / 5 total
ask: Does a fresh form after restart recover the same consumption and latest allowance while requiring approval of any new plan?
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/scan-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 job(s) · 3 planned | unstarted-scan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 APPROVED STUDY | resumed-approved-study
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 revision 2 | resumed-budget
expect: 1 committed / 5 total
expect: 2 protected review
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART resumed
ask: Does restart restore the exact approved plan and consumed calls in no-color output without executing any discovery?
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART drift
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 source content; | same-sha-drift
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 Study draft unavailable | refused-drift-draft
expect: source content;
ask: Does changed source content block a new implicit study even though the Git SHA and dirty flag are unchanged, without suggesting the finding state is resolved?
keys: Escape
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore-source
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART remove-approval
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 accounting is missing | missing-accounting
expect: No work can start
expect-not: 0 committed
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 accounting is missing | refused-draft
require-shell: python3 @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/map_accounting.py @TMP_TARGET @ART missing
ask: Does damaged accounting block new work with useful recovery guidance instead of presenting a reset budget?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
